"OLAYLAR_ARKEOLOJI_ZINCIR:-0112-01-01:0":{"b": ["Dura-Europos: Kekaisaran Seleukia → Kekaisaran Parthia (Arsakid)", "3880f69a"], "d": ["Di titik Dura-Europos, kepemilikan beralih dari Kekaisaran Seleukia ke Kekaisaran Parthia (Arsakid). Informasi sumber peralihan: penaklukan Parthia (ca. 113) | Sumber: Leriche, P. & MacKenzie, D. N., \"Dura Europos\", Encyclopaedia Iranica VII/6, 1996 (rev. 2011); tanggal pendirian dari ringkasan Leriche (cermin kavehfarrokh.com) | https://web.archive.org/web/2025/https://www.iranicaonline.org/articles/dura-europos | «Dura Europos was brought into the Iranian cultural sphere after the Parthian conquest in about 113 B.C.E.»", "100bc82e"]},
